Important catch during verification: my first fix compared only `.host.toLowerCase()`, which wrongly treated same-host/different-path URLs (`/a` vs `/b`) as duplicates. The verification script caught this, so I corrected it to compare `URL.href`, which lowercases only the host while preserving path/search/hash case.

Final fix (`src/import_merge.ts`):
- Same root cause as before: `b.url === inc.url` was case-sensitive, so hostnames differing only in case weren't recognized as duplicates.
- `sameUrl` now uses `new URL(a).href === new URL(b).href` — normalizes host case only, with a fallback to exact string equality if either URL fails to parse. `mergeImports` uses it for matching.
- Lints clean; `Bookmark` type unchanged.


